Jizem
$cards
DECK 2 SPADES

$initial
OJI 9 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST
OJI 4 FACE_ALTERNATE_LAST

VAEMOT 8 FACE_LAST
VAEMOT 5 FACE_LAST

$moves
MOVE OJI VAEMOT
OR
    AND
        DESTSRC Rank add_13
        DESTSRC Rank add_14
    DEST Size < 2
MOVE VAEMOT VAEMOT
DEST Suit {SPADES, DIAMONDS}
$win
OR
    AND
        PILE ALL VAEMOT Empty
        PILE ALL OJI Empty
    AND
        PILE ALL VAEMOT Empty
        PILE ALL OJI Empty
